# =============================================================================
# CONFIDENTIAL DATA - NEVER COMMIT
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The GAM Assurance CatNat portfolio (123,434 live insurance policies) is
# proprietary commercial data received for a hackathon. It contains policy
# numbers, insured capitals, premiums and coverage dates.
# Publishing it would breach the confidentiality terms agreed with the company.
#
# Only COMMUNE-LEVEL AGGREGATES are published (see outputs/ and QGis_files/).
# See docs/DATA_SOURCES.md for the full data-handling policy.
# =============================================================================

# Raw organiser-supplied policy portfolio
CATNAT_2023_2025*.xlsx
CATNAT_2023_2025*.csv

# Row-level classified output (one row per policy - reproduces the raw file)
Algeria_Seismic_Risk_Classified.xlsx

# Any other accidental row-level dump
*_policies.csv
*_policy_level.*


